  "title": "Marie NDE 169",
  "date": "9/11/2000",
  "content": "[On the morning of September 11, 2000], I slipped on wet concrete outside my patio and fell into a deep concussion. I was in an altered state for about two hours before anyone came to my aid. While I was in an altered state, I felt myself being shown flashes of dead people and thinking of helping them. I couldn't reach any of them because they were all in two separate cages. I then woke up and my watch was stopped at 8:56am, which was the time the World Trade Center towers were hit [Wikipedia places the time of the first hit between 8.45-8.50am]. I feel as though someone was trying to tell me what was coming to America. Being Native American, I've felt a closeness to the earth and its senses ever since this experience.",
